  "manifest": {
    "name": "dsh-quake-alert",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "description": "Real-time earthquake, EEW, tsunami and weather alerts: Japan (P2PQuake + JMA telegrams), global earthquakes (EMSC/USGS) and tsunamis (NOAA), mainland China (CENC earthquakes via Wolfx, plus nmc.cn rainstorm / geological-hazard warnings), and US / Canadian weather hazards (NWS flood warnings, ECCC rainfall / storm-surge warnings) — matched against your watch regions and thresholds.",
